  "levelType": "practical",
  "statementHtml": "<p>Given an integer n, <strong>return true if it is a power of two</strong>. Otherwise, return false.</p><p><br></p><p>An integer n is a power of two if there exists an integer x such that<strong> n == 2</strong><sup><strong>x</strong></sup><strong>.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>You must solve it without using loops or recursion.</strong></p>",
  "examples": [
    "<p>Input: n = 1</p><p>Output: true</p><p>Explanation: 2<sup>0</sup> = 1</p>",
    "<p><strong>Input:</strong> n = 16</p><p><strong>Output:</strong> true</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> 2<sup>4</sup> = 16</p>",
    "<p><strong>Input: </strong>n = -8</p>"
  ],
  "constraintsHtml": "<p>-2<sup>31</sup> <= n <= 2<sup>31 </sup>- 1</p>",
